<title>UK: KFW unit sets 1.5 bln Czech crown one-year bond.</title>
<headline>KFW unit sets 1.5 bln Czech crown one-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KFW INTERNATIONAl FINANCE</p>
