<p> AMT    1.5 BLN CZK   COUPON     11 PCT    MATURITY    22.JAN.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.85    PAY DATE    22.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.00	REOFFER    100.0     SPREAD	 =</p>
